{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1085"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/ball-sports","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/sport-games__ball-sports.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",84],["+","golfers call "],["=",2],["-","dimples"],["+","dents"],["=",1],["+","Dimples; they "],["=",52],["-","patented."],["+","patented;"],["=",1],["-","The"],["+","in"],["=",1],["-","dimples"],["+","1905"],["=",1],["-","on"],["+","William"],["=",1],["+","Taylor patented "],["=",2],["-","golf"],["+","dimple"],["=",1],["-","ball"],["+","pattern"],["=",1],["+","that modern balls still follow. What the dimples reduce in flight is air resistance (drag): they "],["=",24],["-","reduces"],["+","so"],["=",1],["-","drag"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","and,"],["+","wake"],["=",1],["+","behind the ball shrinks, and "],["=",4],["-","backspin,"],["+","backspin"],["=",1],["-","generates"],["+","they"],["=",1],["+","generate "],["=",2],["+","Contrary to a popular belief, they do nothing for grip. "],["=",576],["+","All of this grass needs a keeper. The greenkeeper looks after the turf (grass) of the whole course – mowing, rolling, watering and repairing fairways, tees and above all the greens. The job is older than most clubs: in 1864 Old Tom Morris took charge of the links at St Andrews as Keeper of the Green.\n\n"],["=",439]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",78],["+","Golfer nennen "],["=",2],["-","Dimples"],["+","Dellen"],["=",1],["+","Dimples; sie "],["=",52],["-","patentiert."],["+","patentiert;"],["=",1],["-","Die"],["+","1905"],["=",1],["-","Dimples"],["+","ließ"],["=",1],["-","auf"],["+","William"],["=",1],["+","Taylor das Dellenmuster patentieren, "],["=",2],["-","Golfball"],["+","moderne"],["=",1],["+","Bälle bis heute folgen. Im Flug verringern die Dellen den Luftwiderstand: Sie "],["=",22],["-","den"],["+","sodass"],["=",1],["-","Luftwiderstand"],["+","der"],["=",1],["-","verringert"],["+","Nachlauf"],["=",1],["+","hinter dem Ball schrumpft, "],["=",10],["-","Auftrieb"],["+","erzeugen"],["=",1],["-","erzeugt."],["+","sie"],["=",1],["+","Auftrieb. Entgegen einem verbreiteten Glauben tragen sie zur Griffigkeit nichts bei. "],["=",518],["+","All dieses Gras braucht einen Hüter. Der Greenkeeper kümmert sich um den Rasen des ganzen Platzes – er mäht, walzt, bewässert und repariert Fairways, Abschläge und vor allem die Grüns. Der Beruf ist älter als die meisten Clubs: 1864 übernahm Old Tom Morris als Keeper of the Green die Pflege der Links von St Andrews.\n\n"],["=",439]]}]},
